# Upstash Redis (free tier) -- powers the real live-visitor count at /api/presence.
# Sign up at https://upstash.com, create a Redis database, then copy these two
# values from its "REST API" section.
#
# Without these set, /api/presence falls back to an in-memory count that only
# works for local `vercel dev` testing (resets on cold start, not consistent
# across instances) -- set these for real behavior in production.
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL=
UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN=
